    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Geometric relationships between veins,faults, and other structures determined from detailed mapping and exploratory observations at outcrops throughout the Appalachians compare favorably with the structural assemblages and three fluid migration pathways recognized at Bays Mountain, Kingsport, Tenn. Some outcrops, however, have additional structural elements, providing a modification to one of the fluid migration networks.",
